   "text": "University of Portsmouth - Foundation - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nUniversity of Portsmouth - Foundation\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nThe University of Portsmouth is located on the South coast of England and is one of only four universities in the south east to achieve the highest Gold rating in the Teaching Excellence Framework. The University was ranked 21st by The Guardian University Guide 2020, 51st by The Complete University Guide 2019, and 53rd by The Sunday Times University Guide 2018.\nThe International College provides multiple pathways to a broad range of degrees at the university.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n05/05/2026 06:26\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n30/03/2026 07:08\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nPathway\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nYearly Fees\nMax: £13,875.00\nMin: £7,682.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n8%\n1,870 of 24,000 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nNAVITAS\nFounded Year\n1870\nCampus(es)\nPortsmouth\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nExcluded Countries\nAustralia, Cuba, Iran, North Korea, Syria, United States\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n27/03/2026\nContract End Date\n01/04/2029\nContract Entity\nQS Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nAccommodation available\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NofNNnhbd7k\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
